  "historyNote": "#4025, eff 3-26-86; amd by #4178, eff 12-4-86, EXPIRED: 3-26-92 and 12-4-92 New. #6536, eff 7-2-97, EXPIRED: 7-2-05 New. #9767, eff 8-21-10, EXPIRED: 8-21-18",
